{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05576","headline":"夜光篇 · 王泠然","name":"夜光篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游人夜到汝阳间，夜色冥蒙不解颜。\n谁家暗起寒山烧，因此明中得见山。\n山头山下须臾满，历险缘深无暂断。\n焦声散着羣树鸣，炎气傍林一川暖。\n是时西北多海风，吹上连天光更雄。\n浊烟熏月黑，高艳爇云红。\n初谓炼丹仙竈里，还疑铸劒神谿中。\n划爲飞电来照物，乍作流星并上空。\n西山无草光已灭，东顶荧荧犹未绝。\n沸汤空谷数道水，融盖阴崖几年雪。\n两京贫病若爲居，四壁皆成凿照余。\n未得贵游同秉烛，唯将半影借披书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王泠然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}